<title>AUSTRALIA: Australia's Costello in Melbourne for CPI data.</title>
<headline>Australia's Costello in Melbourne for CPI data.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a news conference on Wednesday in Melbourne at 0200 GMT (12.00 p.m.), his office said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Costello will comment on the June quarter inflation figures and announce the 1996/97 preliminary budget outcome.</p>
<p>The inflation data will be released at 11.30 a.m. (0130 GMT) by the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
